{"4626580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Endless Isolation", "steam_appid": 4626580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4626580/extras/d086bc7bf9d2e4a058e8e28b2c288960.poster.avif?t=1787906154\" width=480 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4626580/extras/d086bc7bf9d2e4a058e8e28b2c288960.webm?t=1787906154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4626580/extras/d086bc7bf9d2e4a058e8e28b2c288960.mp4?t=1787906154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your shift at Viralith Corporation has come to an end. As you enter your apartment building, you encounter anxious neighbors. You wake up in the middle of the night to the sound of someone breaking down your door, and soon you realize that you are now on an isolated island swarming with monsters. Now you must find a way to escape this island alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Fight monsters and survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have a wide variety of weapons at your disposal. But remember, in this place ammunition is more valuable than gold. Carefully choose your targets and decide when to engage in combat and when it is better to retreat and conserve resources for a more serious threat. The path to freedom will become more and more difficult. Be prepared for the fact that the concentration of monsters and the complexity of spatial challenges will increase with every step you take. Will you have enough resources for the final push?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4626580/extras/076449d710d148cc336652431742483f.poster.avif?t=1787906154\" width=480 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4626580/extras/076449d710d148cc336652431742483f.webm?t=1787906154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4626580/extras/076449d710d148cc336652431742483f.mp4?t=1787906154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you dive into the history of the appearance of the monsters, the clearer it becomes that some secrets were better left undiscovered. Search for notes, study the environment, and find out what really happened on this island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4626580/extras/e29bdd4d398aa66b31ea9c73929d74c1.poster.avif?t=1787906154\" width=480 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4626580/extras/e29bdd4d398aa66b31ea9c73929d74c1.webm?t=1787906154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4626580/extras/e29bdd4d398aa66b31ea9c73929d74c1.mp4?t=1787906154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Resource Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose which item to save for later and what you need right now. Every bullet and every medkit counts, what is the better choice at the moment? Fight or run?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4626580/extras/a519c97dc513f48644a2ce6df9845dfb.poster.avif?t=1787906154\" width=480 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4626580/extras/a519c97dc513f48644a2ce6df9845dfb.webm?t=1787906154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4626580/extras/a519c97dc513f48644a2ce6df9845dfb.mp4?t=1787906154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the locations, around the corner or under the stairs there may be something useful for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4626580/extras/5edc0612d2be4702d3d309c044eeb396.poster.avif?t=1787906154\" width=480 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4626580/extras/5edc0612d2be4702d3d309c044eeb396.webm?t=1787906154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4626580/extras/5edc0612d2be4702d3d309c044eeb396.mp4?t=1787906154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Classic Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locked doors and strange puzzles will become your main obstacle. Study the environment, gather clues bit by bit, and solve classic puzzles to escape from this island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4626580/extras/75cf068ca411521aab3b81faffa57c1d.poster.avif?t=1787906154\" width=480 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4626580/extras/75cf068ca411521aab3b81faffa57c1d.webm?t=1787906154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4626580/extras/75cf068ca411521aab3b81faffa57c1d.mp4?t=1787906154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Retro Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a PSX-style aesthetic reimagined with modern technology. If you prefer a clear image, pixelation can be instantly disabled in the settings while preserving the overall visual style of the game. Will you be able to escape from this island?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4626580/extras/7276c626242916426f7e8a0cf8acb262.poster.avif?t=1787906154\" width=480 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4626580/extras/7276c626242916426f7e8a0cf8acb262.webm?t=1787906154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4626580/extras/7276c626242916426f7e8a0cf8acb262.mp4?t=1787906154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Additional Content &quot;Horde Mode&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is to survive and escape from the house! Generators are your source of income, they produce coins needed to purchase items and upgrades. With each round, the waves of monsters become larger and stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Additional Content &quot;Survivor&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the last one left alive on this island. Your goal is to reach the shore within 20 minutes. Resources are limited, ammunition and medkits are given only once for the entire game. Every shot and every heal must be justified.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4626580/extras/d086bc7bf9d2e4a058e8e28b2c288960.poster.avif?t=1787906154\" width=480 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4626580/extras/d086bc7bf9d2e4a058e8e28b2c288960.webm?t=1787906154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4626580/extras/d086bc7bf9d2e4a058e8e28b2c288960.mp4?t=1787906154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your shift at Viralith Corporation has come to an end. As you enter your apartment building, you encounter anxious neighbors. You wake up in the middle of the night to the sound of someone breaking down your door, and soon you realize that you are now on an isolated island swarming with monsters. Now you must find a way to escape this island alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Fight monsters and survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have a wide variety of weapons at your disposal. But remember, in this place ammunition is more valuable than gold. Carefully choose your targets and decide when to engage in combat and when it is better to retreat and conserve resources for a more serious threat. The path to freedom will become more and more difficult. Be prepared for the fact that the concentration of monsters and the complexity of spatial challenges will increase with every step you take. Will you have enough resources for the final push?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"